title: "vehicle-dynamics-python: Single-track vehicle models for control and reinforcement learning"
abstract: >-
  Linear, path-error, and nonlinear single-track (bicycle) vehicle models
  with linear and Pacejka tyres, numerical linearization, exact
  discretization, standard open-loop steering maneuvers, and a test suite
  that checks the physics.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
license: MIT
